  "description": "Tout Terrain Tribeca Xpress GT Select 3.1: The Ultimate Pinion Belt-Drive All-Road Commuter\nTake a shortcut through the park or just take the whole week off—the Tribeca Xpress GT is ready to take you far beyond your horizons. This bike is a true all-rounder: a sophisticated city bike with a premium Pinion drive and a reliable Gates Carbon Drive belt, perfectly at home on all surfaces from paved roads to rugged gravel paths.\nEnjoy years of worry-free cycling thanks to the unbeatable combination of the Pinion C1.12 gearbox and the zero-maintenance Gates Carbon Drive. The robust Tribeca Xpress steel frame uses the Tout Terrain Stratocrom Tube Set, paired with an Allroad Fork, providing legendary durability and a comfortable ride.\nThe versatile 28-inch wheels are optimized for speed and efficiency, while the drop-style handlebars with the Shift:R Road System enable smooth gear changes and offer a variety of comfortable riding positions for long days out. The bike comes fully equipped with a Shutter PL-7 hub dynamo, premium Busch + Müller lighting, and SKS fenders/racks, making it an exceptional touring and commuter bike.\nCORE FEATURES FOR THE ADVENTUROUS COMMUTER:\nDrive System: Maintenance-free Pinion C1.12 Gearbox and Gates Carbon Belt Drive.\nFrame: Durable and comfortable Tribeca Xpress steel frame with Tout Terrain Stratocrom Tube Set.\nVersatility: True All-Road capability, excelling on City streets and Gravel paths.\nCapacity: High maximum capacity of 130kg (frame) and 15kg (rack).\nComponents: TRP Hylex hydraulic disc brakes, Shutter PL-7 hub dynamo, and full SKS mudguard/rack setup.\n\nSPECIFICATIONS\nSpecifications are subject to change at any time without notice.\n\nFRAME: Tribeca Xpress steel frame | Tout Terrain Stratocrom Tube Set",
